{"id": "I-1", "translation": "梵語：Bodhisattvacaryāvatāra。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "5d95d05571bc", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 1, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["0", "I-0", "I-1", "I-2", "I-3", "1-0"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:16:40"}
{"id": "I-2", "translation": "藏語：《入菩薩行論》。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "5d95d05571bc", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 1, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["0", "I-0", "I-1", "I-2", "I-3", "1-0"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:16:40"}
{"id": "I-3", "translation": "頂禮一切佛與菩薩。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "5d95d05571bc", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 2, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["0", "I-0", "I-1", "I-2", "I-3", "1-0"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:16:40"}
{"id": "1-0", "translation": "第一品 解說菩提心利益", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "5d95d05571bc", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 2, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["0", "I-0", "I-1", "I-2", "I-3", "1-0"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:16:40"}
{"id": "1-7", "translation": "經歷多劫善加思惟之\n諸牟尼之主見唯此有益，\n依此，無量之人眾\n將輕易獲得最勝樂。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "82c4b2078bd2", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 3, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-7", "1-8", "1-9", "1-10", "1-11", "1-12"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:14"}
{"id": "1-8", "translation": "欲摧毀數百有之苦，\n欲消除有情之不樂，\n以及欲享受數百安樂者，\n亦恆時不應捨棄菩提心。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "82c4b2078bd2", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 4, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-7", "1-8", "1-9", "1-10", "1-11", "1-12"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:14"}
{"id": "1-9", "translation": "若生起菩提心，剎那之間，\n繫縛於輪迴牢獄之苦難者，\n即被稱為諸善逝之佛子，\n且將受世間連同天人所頂禮。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "82c4b2078bd2", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 6, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-7", "1-8", "1-9", "1-10", "1-11", "1-12"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:14"}
{"id": "1-10", "translation": "猶如殊勝之點金藥，\n取此不淨之身，\n轉化為無價之勝者之身寶，\n故當極其堅固受持名為菩提心者。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "82c4b2078bd2", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 5, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-7", "1-8", "1-9", "1-10", "1-11", "1-12"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:14"}
{"id": "1-11", "translation": "眾生唯一之商主以無量智慧，\n善加全面觀察而見其極為珍貴，\n欲脫離眾生之處所者，\n當善加堅固受持珍貴之菩提心。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "82c4b2078bd2", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 3, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-7", "1-8", "1-9", "1-10", "1-11", "1-12"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:14"}
{"id": "1-12", "translation": "其他一切善皆如芭蕉，\n生出果之後即會枯竭；\n然而菩提心之樹恆常\n生出果，不盡且增長。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "82c4b2078bd2", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 4, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-7", "1-8", "1-9", "1-10", "1-11", "1-12"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:14"}
{"id": "1-13", "translation": "縱使造下極難忍之罪業，\n猶如依止勇士能脫大怖畏，\n依止何者能於須臾得解脫，\n具謹慎者為何不依止於此？", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "6d02630c4782", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 1, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-13", "1-14", "1-15", "1-16", "1-17", "1-18"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:24"}
{"id": "1-14", "translation": "彼如劫末之火將諸大罪，\n於一剎那之間必定焚毀，\n其無可估量之利益，\n具慧彌勒怙主已為善財宣說。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "6d02630c4782", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 3, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-13", "1-14", "1-15", "1-16", "1-17", "1-18"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:24"}
{"id": "1-15", "translation": "簡而言之彼菩提心，\n應當了知分為兩種：\n亦即願菩提心，\n以及行菩提心。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "6d02630c4782", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 3, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-13", "1-14", "1-15", "1-16", "1-17", "1-18"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:24"}
{"id": "1-16", "translation": "猶如欲前往與正前往，\n其差別如何被了知般，\n如是智者對於此二者，\n亦應次第了知其差別。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "6d02630c4782", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 1, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-13", "1-14", "1-15", "1-16", "1-17", "1-18"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:24"}
{"id": "1-17", "translation": "由願菩提心，\n於輪迴之時雖能生大果，\n然未能如行菩提心般，\n福德相續不斷而生起。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "6d02630c4782", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 5, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-13", "1-14", "1-15", "1-16", "1-17", "1-18"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:24"}
{"id": "1-18", "translation": "自從為了令有情界，\n無邊際者皆得徹底解脫，\n而以不退轉之心，\n真實受持彼心時起，", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "6d02630c4782", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 3, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-13", "1-14", "1-15", "1-16", "1-17", "1-18"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:24"}
{"id": "1-1", "translation": "具備法身之善逝及其子，\n以及一切應頂禮者，我皆恭敬頂禮；\n關於趣入善逝之子之律儀，\n我將依據聖教簡要宣說。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "d0f09846c05b", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 5, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-1", "1-2", "1-3", "1-4", "1-5", "1-6"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:25"}
{"id": "1-2", "translation": "此處並無前所未有之說，\n我亦不具備詞章之善巧；\n因此我並無利益他人之念，\n我為修習自心而撰此論。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "d0f09846c05b", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 0, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-1", "1-2", "1-3", "1-4", "1-5", "1-6"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:25"}
{"id": "1-3", "translation": "為修習善，我之信力\n藉由此等亦將暫時增長；\n若與我緣分相同之他人，\n見及此等，亦將具有意義。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "d0f09846c05b", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 2, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-1", "1-2", "1-3", "1-4", "1-5", "1-6"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:25"}
{"id": "1-4", "translation": "此暇滿極難獲得；\n既然已得成辦士夫義利者，\n若未於此成辦利益，\n日後怎能再次圓滿獲得？", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "d0f09846c05b", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 2, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-1", "1-2", "1-3", "1-4", "1-5", "1-6"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:25"}
{"id": "1-5", "translation": "猶如漆黑夜晚之烏雲中，\n閃電剎那展現耀眼光明；\n同樣仰仗佛之威力，\n世間偶爾生起修福德之慧。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "d0f09846c05b", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 3, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-1", "1-2", "1-3", "1-4", "1-5", "1-6"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:25"}
{"id": "1-6", "translation": "因此善恆常微弱，\n罪業勢力強大且極其猛烈；\n除正等菩提心外，\n還有何種其他善能將其鎮伏？", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "d0f09846c05b", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 4, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-1", "1-2", "1-3", "1-4", "1-5", "1-6"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:25"}
{"id": "1-19", "translation": "從此時起縱睡眠，\n抑或處於放逸中，\n眾多福德之勢力，\n無間等空極生起。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "9406c08a3b91", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 2, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-19", "1-20", "1-21", "1-22", "1-23", "1-24"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:31"}
{"id": "1-20", "translation": "連同此中之正理，\n於《妙臂所問》之中，\n為利下劣信解有情，\n如來親自作宣說。", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "9406c08a3b91", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 4, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-19", "1-20", "1-21", "1-22", "1-23", "1-24"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:31"}
{"id": "1-21", "translation": "有情些微之頭疾，\n縱然思惟欲淨除，\n彼具利益之意樂，\n若尚獲無量福德；", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "9406c08a3b91", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 2, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-19", "1-20", "1-21", "1-22", "1-23", "1-24"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:31"}
{"id": "1-22", "translation": "一一有情之不樂，\n無量無邊欲淨除，\n且欲一一皆成就，\n無量功德何須言？", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "9406c08a3b91", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 2, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-19", "1-20", "1-21", "1-22", "1-23", "1-24"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:31"}
{"id": "1-23", "translation": "不論父親或母親，\n誰有此般利益心？\n不論諸天或仙人，\n抑或梵天有此乎？", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "9406c08a3b91", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 3, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-19", "1-20", "1-21", "1-22", "1-23", "1-24"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:31"}
{"id": "1-24", "translation": "彼等有情於往昔，\n為求自利此般心，\n若於夢中未曾夢，\n為他之利焉能生？", "variant": "academic", "call_id": "9406c08a3b91", "attempt": 1, "model": "gemini-3.1-pro-preview", "terms_required": 1, "terms_missed": [], "batch": ["1-19", "1-20", "1-21", "1-22", "1-23", "1-24"], "ts": "2026-10-08T13:17:31"}
